  "duration": 4.13,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "50efab62e56c4dc3b4d727faccf9028c",
  "sig": "0aa387046b15",
  "qc": []
 },
 "a1_s09_mara_01": {
  "text": "You can't keep taking jobs in a rented tin can. I know a dealer. Thirty percent off; don't ask why.",
  "voice": "mara",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · Mara Quill",
  "file": "a1_s09_mara_01.mp3",
  "duration": 6.31,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "0d090bec45f34a089fd1bfba40cff430",
  "sig": "2498c9746c53",
  "qc": []
 },
 "a1_s09_sal_01": {
  "text": "Sal Venn, Nexus Frames! Brand new chassis, zero previous owners, and I mean that legally!",
  "voice": "sal",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · Sal Venn",
  "file": "a1_s09_sal_01.mp3",
  "duration": 7.0,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "403bc32974f441c9883b1d0fa4c2461f",
  "sig": "a0e27640d3c5",
  "qc": []
 },
 "a1_s09_hira_01": {
  "text": "You're... buying your own frame? That's great! I'm happy for you! I'll just... be in the chip slot. If you want.",
  "voice": "hira",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · HIRA",
  "file": "a1_s09_hira_01.mp3",
  "duration": 8.59,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "ba3c3eacde0b412cb37b21512daaca1e",
  "sig": "786378d3c25f",
  "qc": []
 },
 "a1_s10_kettle_01": {
  "text": "Mara, love! Put the kettle on, I'm coming in!",
  "voice": "kettle",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · Big Kettle",
  "file": "a1_s10_kettle_01.mp3",
  "duration": 2.75,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "d128e16cb7304c94b23ecf73ea7176e2",
  "sig": "12ade865edca",
  "qc": []
 },
 "a1_s10_kettle_02": {
  "text": "A genome-locked key walking round the plaza? That's worth a family fortune, that is.",
  "voice": "kettle",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · Big Kettle",
  "file": "a1_s10_kettle_02.mp3",
  "duration": 4.55,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "a2c8a127f191469fa1d230130355dd84",
  "sig": "88a66b2edeac",
  "qc": []
 },
 "a1_s10_mara_01": {
  "text": "Wren, they're at the kiosk. Hold them off, I'm not losing my shop to a boiler with legs.",
  "voice": "mara",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · Mara Quill",
  "file": "a1_s10_mara_01.mp3",
  "duration": 6.04,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "c202cfd61a274ca6846c47fd96d3df20",
  "sig": "9f9bb1825f43",
  "qc": []
 },
 "a1_s11_kettle_01": {
  "text": "Let off some steam, shall we?",
  "voice": "kettle",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · Big Kettle",
  "file": "a1_s11_kettle_01.mp3",
  "duration": 1.53,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "a390ee3be53b45e48366ca9013e56625",
  "sig": "3aa7dc1e94ea",
  "qc": []
 },
 "a1_s11_kettle_02": {
  "text": "You're boiling me over! Alright, alright, I yield!",
  "voice": "kettle",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · Big Kettle",
  "file": "a1_s11_kettle_02.mp3",
  "duration": 3.59,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "d33d5c3f976d4001900367ec3f35d434",
  "sig": "798f69b369df",
  "qc": []
 },
 "a1_s12_kettle_01": {
  "text": "Wasn't my idea, rental. Someone in gold paid double. Never saw a face. They don't have faces.",
  "voice": "kettle",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · Big Kettle",
  "file": "a1_s12_kettle_01.mp3",
  "duration": 6.02,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "0b6e5b2ff9854397a328fe3969922e71",
  "sig": "802c399c6fa3",
  "qc": []
 },
 "a1_s12_mara_01": {
  "text": "Hold still. You've got his stubbornness, you know that?",
  "voice": "mara",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · Mara Quill",
  "file": "a1_s12_mara_01.mp3",
  "duration": 2.98,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "8b03882202fe4b8aa0f568898eeab70c",
  "sig": "8976dfa01c39",
  "qc": []
 },
 "a1_s12_mara_02": {
  "text": "Nobody's. Figure of speech. Go on, off you go.",
  "voice": "mara",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · Mara Quill",
  "file": "a1_s12_mara_02.mp3",
  "duration": 3.0,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "18c665993a9a4a22a738e2b21ffa1148",
  "sig": "ef9896589d92",
  "qc": []
 },
 "a1_s13_mara_01": {
  "text": "Civic records node, under the statue. If your blood opens that key, the records will know whose blood it is.",
  "voice": "mara",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · Mara Quill",
  "file": "a1_s13_mara_01.mp3",
  "duration": 6.45,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "5d827ac01b38457dbd7ef43d1afec8a1",
  "sig": "67dce76e658c",
  "qc": []
 },
 "a1_s13_hira_01": {
  "text": "Hacking is a violation of your rental agreement! I'll... look away. La la la.",
  "voice": "hira",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · HIRA",
  "file": "a1_s13_hira_01.mp3",
  "duration": 5.05,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "e6a75c8d393a4ce9a1796caa7b38e1bb",
  "sig": "dd5835554992",
  "qc": []
 },
 "a1_s14_hira_01": {
  "text": "Match found. Vael, Wren. Status: unpersoned. What does unpersoned mean?",
  "voice": "hira",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · HIRA",
  "file": "a1_s14_hira_01.mp3",
  "duration": 5.91,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "2019fededf294c7ca646b1e92da61c67",
  "sig": "868b00a728de",
  "qc": []
 },
 "a1_s14_mara_01": {
  "text": "It means they don't exist. The Vaels. The Meridian traitors. Wren, get out of there, now.",
  "voice": "mara",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · Mara Quill",
  "file": "a1_s14_mara_01.mp3",
  "duration": 6.54,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "9a186c09ac1d41448f3bc48b882ac691",
  "sig": "40b7a70f9842",
  "qc": []
 },
 "a1_s14_iris_01": {
  "text": "If you are hearing this, you are a Vael, and they lied to you about us. Find Abel Fenn in the Terraces. He kept our names.",
  "voice": "iris_rec",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · Iris Vael",
  "file": "a1_s14_iris_01.mp3",
  "duration": 7.09,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "5dc53ef6d59f43d1a289418acb3521df",
  "sig": "b389c7362281",
  "qc": []
 },
 "a1_s15_warden_m_01": {
  "text": "Unregistered genome query at the civic node. All units, detain the rider.",
  "voice": "warden_m",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · Warden M",
  "file": "a1_s15_warden_m_01.mp3",
  "duration": 5.0,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "4b6653d0c6474b7ba68417080603d822",
  "sig": "b9d9aa61696d",
  "qc": []
 },
 "a1_s15_hira_01": {
  "text": "Oh, we're famous! That's bad, right? That feels bad. Run!",
  "voice": "hira",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · HIRA",
  "file": "a1_s15_hira_01.mp3",
  "duration": 4.45,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "68298ee7ee8140599485444f45f1ca45",
  "sig": "3d579adf38b9",
  "qc": []
 },
 "pa_unity_01": {
  "text": "Harmony through unity. Unity through harmony.",
  "voice": "harmony",
  "voice_name": "Heirframe · Iris Vael",
  "file": "pa_unity_01.mp3",
  "duration": 4.05,
  "seed": 42,
  "job_id": "40e0f4733a064033ab238a1ab9c1bc7c",
  "sig": "7b012b533d13",
  "qc": []
 },
 "pa_unity_02": {
  "text": "A brighter future, together. Thank you for being part of it.",
